WEBVTT

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:15.780
Even though I'm wandering
around a very precarious place

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:20.850
my weakness appears and disappears

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:25.990
This is no time to hesitate,
because there's only one answer

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:30.590
in this world bathed in morning light

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:35.630
At the ends of my memories
in which only kindness rests

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:40.770
whose smile appeared?

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:44.870
Little by little, my memories fade away

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:48.710
as I cast everything off

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:53.450
New flames are being born

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:59.890
Even if there's nothing
but despair, I won't give up

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:08.960
I want to proudly stand tall until the very end

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:17.640
I'm certain you'll find
something that only you can do

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:28.850
so let's keep our eyes on
it and strive for tomorrow

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:32.750
Go, Elea!

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:37.180
Xargin. God's teachings
aren't about winning or losing.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:42.190
Why did XAT have to be wiped out?!

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:48.200
Just how many more lives
must you take until you change?!

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:52.810
Elea!

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:57.350
In one hour the Isis will
activate inside Joseph's body.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:00.380
You need to hold out until then somehow.

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:05.690
I'll have Victor fix the Bow-rider's
energy lines and cooling somehow.

00:02:05.690 --> 00:02:08.560
'Cause I know you're listening, Victor!

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:13.360
If Sasha dies, so will
Mei-Fong, who's fighting for you.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.670
If you're really a god, it should be simple!

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:21.240
Very well. I'll reroute
lines from the D Deck plant.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:25.910
Sasha. Just to be safe, you should
connect to the cooling plant too.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:28.980
Understood, Commander.

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:34.020
I sent the hacked
missile data to the Scale-rider.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.690
It would be unbeautiful for you to die.

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:38.850
Thanks, Elea.

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:40.820
Good luck!

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:45.290
Mei-Fong. Analyze the ICBM as much as you can.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:47.730
Find out where I should hit it.

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.060
I'm already on it.

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:52.590
Sasha. Can the commander be saved?

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:55.500
I'm not really sure I...

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.870
Okay. I understand.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:00.710
Minuteman 5000 Disturbed Mirage.

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:03.710
Maximum payload of 16 nuclear warheads.

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:07.050
Maximum exo-atmospheric speed, Mach 23.

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:09.050
Maximum atmospheric speed, Mach 5.

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:11.850
At full speed, it'll reach
EU airspace in 40 minutes.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:16.120
Booster purge upon atmospheric
reentry at 150 kilometers elevation,

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:21.360
high-altitude unit purge 40,000
meters over Germany five minutes later,

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:24.630
and then two minutes until all of Germany is...

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:28.900
I have the enemy's ID codes,
so I'll try approaching the ICBM.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:33.540
And, just in case, I'll also
lay a countdown timer trap,

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:37.050
so we'll run Operation
Gamma on my voice command.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:43.350
I'll find a hit point in the 30 minutes
that it's between 3000 and 200 km.

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:47.120
The sniping point will be
at 150 km in EU airspace.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:50.730
Shoot just before the target
executes the booster purge.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:54.500
Got it. I'll get everything
ready within the next 30 minutes.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.190
Let's both do our very best.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:39.070
Every one from the least even unto
the greatest is given to covetousness,

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:42.840
from the prophet even unto the
priest every one dealeth falsely.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:46.850
For they have healed the
hurt of my people slightly,

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:51.520
saying, Peace, peace; when there is no peace.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:56.720
Hey, what's going on?!
If you're here, that means!

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:59.760
You promised Amanda
you'd protect Malek, damn it!

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:01.760
What the hell're you losing for?!

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.730
Stop, Hermann.

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:06.840
If he wakes up here, he really will!

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.340
Move.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:10.270
But he's!

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:14.710
This man did not strike me
down because I was a monster.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:21.680
I asked him... Joseph... to do it,
to atone for the sins I had committed.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:26.690
Thus, Joseph bore the sins and
suffering Malek and I had carried

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:30.660
and endured a life of
isolation and discrimination.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:33.660
If only I had a strong will like Joseph's...

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.100
Gerd...

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:38.400
That's why I'm going to
do what little I can now...

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:40.400
What are you going to do?!

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:43.140
I'm going to go buy time.

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:46.410
Hold on, Gerd.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.740
If things start to get bad, use this.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:50.810
You're the champ; it should
be second-nature for you.

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:54.180
I appreciate it, Hermann.

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:14.430
So that is your power, Joseph?

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:20.530
I won't fall for the same trick twice!

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:27.980
The hit point is the docking bay
between the main body and the booster!

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:29.880
The interference is really bad!

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:32.620
It worries me, so I'm going to
try inspecting it from close up

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:36.520
until they detect my enemy ID code!

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:40.030
Tachyon particles? It couldn't be!

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:45.300
A super-electromagnetic field!

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:48.640
The Bow-rider's charged particle
cannon won't have any effect on it!

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:50.840
Sasha! Change of schedule!

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:54.540
Fire after I use a bunker buster
to blow a hole in its underside!

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:55.870
Roger!

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:01.020
Mei-Fong. Shake them off.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:03.080
We only have one shot at taking it down.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.450
The Bow-rider can't handle much more!

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:59.370
This is the extent of your power?

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.080
- Ready to fire!
- Roger!

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:17.590
I hit the center of the booster docking bay.

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:21.130
Its speed has reduced from Mach 23 to Mach 20.

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:24.930
Understood. Error correction
generator output at 120%.

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:27.490
Target auto-chaser on.

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:49.760
I'm sorry, Joseph...

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:51.930
Gerd!

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:55.160
Hermann. You know what needs to be done.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.770
But, he's!

00:08:57.770 --> 00:09:00.170
We're counting on you...

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:06.970
Fine...

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:11.210
Listen, you! This isn't for your sake!

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:17.410
I'm doing this for Amanda!

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:36.040
You Xargin?!

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:40.870
I'm gonna personally take you to see Beatrice!

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:55.060
Main enemy target confirmed!

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:58.790
Got it. Switching to Operation Beta.

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:03.400
I'll manage one more shot
somehow! Leave it to me, Mei-Fong!

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:09.000
I can't snipe it when it's ultra-mobile.
I'm switching to diffusion mode.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:12.410
I'm going to fire after it leaves the
atmosphere, so attack when it evades!

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:13.910
Roger!

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:16.710
I need to shoot it down!

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:19.980
The Bow-rider can't withstand any more of this!

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:27.020
7th-generation models are advanced, all right.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:31.830
It's about to reenter the atmosphere!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:36.430
Got it. Leave the rest to me.

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:39.490
Please, just one more shot...

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:43.530
Hang in there, Bow-rider!

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:46.540
It's done!

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:50.550
You've finally succeeded in
creating a prototype Pale Horse?!

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:54.040
Well done, Sasha Jobson!

00:10:55.150 --> 00:11:01.020
And then, using Joseph and his data as a basis,

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:04.250
I modified and completed the Pale Horse...

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:12.760
I'm sorry... I died first, before
I could see what happened to you...

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:22.740
Evacuate, Sasha Jobson!

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:28.380
Not even being burned in the
fires of Hell can atone for my sins!

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:31.650
Compared to the suffering
you two have gone through...

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:44.530
Sasha!

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:51.410
Shido... Sasha...

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:54.700
I will bring it down! I swear it!

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:13.290
Operation Gamma, ten-count!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:16.990
I will stop Grandfather!

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:38.350
Mei-Fong...

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:45.790
So, how old will my granddaughter
live to be? Tell me, Professor.

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:49.800
Clones grow and age at a
rate similar to deterioration.

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:52.800
I don't think Mei-Fong-kun will
live much beyond the age of 20...

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:58.940
Why?! Why must my daughter
and granddaughter die before me?!

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:00.610
This may interest you.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:03.840
It's a research paper by Sasha Jobson.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:09.410
Nanomachines? Th-This is!

00:13:11.190 --> 00:13:15.780
Why did I... Mei-Fong...

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:45.210
I'm not finished yet!

00:13:57.400 --> 00:14:02.860
Sorry... Th-This is as far as I can go...

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.580
The result will be the same every time!

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:22.920
Come, and let us return unto the Lord:

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.860
For he hath torn, and he will heal us;

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:29.600
he hath smitten, and he will bind us up.

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:34.470
Then shall we know, if we
follow on to know the Lord:

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:37.770
His going forth is prepared as the morning;

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:43.210
and he shall come unto us as the rain.

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:48.750
Do you still not understand?
I have surpassed your power.

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:53.220
What?! Don't tell me
this is a true Blassreiter?!

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:55.690
Do you understand, Xargin?

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:07.000
The Demoniacs have been freed from your control.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:11.370
You should have beaten me and
done something when you had the chance.

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:13.270
You're out of time.

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:16.780
It would seem the Isis inside
you has begun to activate.

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:20.920
Power directed at the
weak is not true power at all!

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:26.220
Oh? Now that you're stronger than me,
you won't use power against me?

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.860
Let's see about that, then.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:32.860
However, trying to shed your
blood on me will accomplish nothing.

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:36.930
Your blood will vaporize before it can touch me.

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:38.830
Let's find out, Xargin!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.800
Indeed, there's more to power than strength.

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:45.370
As a person, you've lost the
most important thing to you!

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:50.280
I'm afraid not, Joseph.
I abandoned it of my own accord.

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:51.980
Then there's nothing that can be done.

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:53.500
Here I come!

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.860
Goodbye, Joseph.

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:04.530
Xargin!

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:09.960
Do you still not realize
what we Blassreiters have lost?

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:13.300
And you've found this thing we've lost?

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:19.270
The true strength of those who
died with despair but clung to hope...

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:21.610
You surely know about that!

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:25.850
- And you came to give that to me?
- That's right!

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:28.950
But it looks like it was for naught.

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:32.250
As a chosen one, I make things happen.

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:35.520
That is the very will of God, after all.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:43.100
The hour is come, that the
Son of man should be glorified.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.930
Verily, verily, I say unto you...

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:53.640
Except a corn of wheat fall into
the ground and die, it abideth alone:

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:57.300
But if it die, it bringeth forth much fruit.

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:24.070
I see. This is the power of the Isis...

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:26.700
So I wasn't it?

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:30.870
It is done.

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:39.520
Malek!

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:41.060
Is Malek alive?!

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:44.560
Of course he is. Joseph promised you.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:46.090
Thank goodness!

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:47.960
Thank you, Elea!

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:49.760
So, how did the fight go?

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:51.470
I'm not detecting them anymore,

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:56.100
so the Isis must have sent
both Joseph and Xargin to Heaven.

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:58.740
I see. The Isis...

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:00.710
So what do we do with this kid?

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:02.840
He'll turn himself into the police tomorrow.

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:06.550
You're not going to run away?
He's killed people, you know!

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:08.550
I don't care how many years it takes.

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:10.680
I'll let him atone for his sins first,

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:14.090
and then I'll keep him safe for sure this time.

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:17.360
And here I was about to help you escape, too...

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:21.730
Oh, that's right. Joseph
wanted you to have that.

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:23.260
He gave this to me?

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:26.670
After all, you still believe in God, right?

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:32.310
If, after everything is said and done,
there's someone who still survives...

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:35.940
...then that is our salvation as Blassreiters.

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:56.060
Is it true that strict teacher
is being discharged today?

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:59.970
Yeah. Even though she
apparently restarted XAT all by herself...

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:01.600
Amanda Werner.

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:05.940
I would have very much liked
you to remain here as an instructor...

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:09.080
My term of service was five
years, as per the plea bargain.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:10.880
I'm going to take care of Malek now.

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:16.850
Actually, speaking of Malek-kun,
he applied to XAT's guerrilla squad.

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:17.790
So I was hoping to pair you two together,

